  "analysis_md": "令 $r=u=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}$，$\\quad \\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}=\\frac{x}{r}，\\quad \\frac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x^2}=\\frac{r-x\\frac{x}{r}}{r^2}=\\frac{y^2+z^2}{r^3}=\\frac{y^2+z^2}{(x^2+y^2+z^2)^{3/2}}$",
  "search_text": "设 $u=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}$，则 $u_{xx}=(\\quad)$。 $\\frac{x^2+z^2}{x^2+y^2+z^2}$ $\\frac{y^2+z^2}{x^2+y^2+z^2}$ $\\frac{x^2+z^2}{(x^2+y^2+z^2)^{3/2}}$ $\\frac{y^2+z^2}{(x^2+y^2+z^2)^{3/2}}$ 令 $r=u=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}$，$\\quad \\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}=\\frac{x}{r}，\\quad \\frac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x^2}=\\frac{r-x\\frac{x}{r}}{r^2}=\\frac{y^2+z^2}{r^3}=\\frac{y^2+z^2}{(x^2+y^2+z^2)^{3/2}}$",
